omnes Gentes,</HI>  Ibid.</P> <P COM="1386">MILTIADES, Ecclesiarum Sophista, II, 548 A.</P> <P COM="1386">PROCULUS, adhuc Catholicus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">adv. Valent.,</HI>  quem
